at the breeding stock listed is registered with the JRTCA and that the breeders listed have agreed to adhere to the JRTCA Code of Ethics. The test results listed in the ads have not been verified by the JRTCA. Please contact the breeder directly for documentation.<\/p>\n<p>Any complaints regarding a breeder listed in the directory must be sent in writing to the JRTCA; complaints will be thoroughly investigated, and if found to be warranted, action taken accordingly.<\/p>\n<p><b>IMPORTANT:<\/b>\u00a0The JRTCA does not become involved in financial or contractual disputes between buyer and seller. It is the responsibility of the buyer to get all guarantees and details of purchase in writing at the time of purchase.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><div id=\"panel-9-1-3-2\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-last-child\" data-index=\"9\" >\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><div style=\"font-size: .8em;\">Banner photos courtesy of Cson Johnson<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>All Terrain Allstar\/Down-N-Dirty Avalanche Acres Black Brush Blue Lightning Bojaxs British Grit Cedar Grove Conasauga Devon Diamond Gates Dutch Creek Fair Dinkum Fiery Fox Harmony Chase Hart Farms Hi Cotton Hidden Acres Huckle Hill Jack&#8217;n Around Jigsaw Julsby Legendary Leap&#8217;n River Lockenlode Madenhaven Acres Mockingbird Hills Moon Crest Mousemoor Northgate Rabble Rouser River Bottom Rock [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"templates\/template-full.php","meta":{"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-9","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","post"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>List of Jack Russell Terrier Breeders - JRTCA Breeders Directory<\/title>\n<meta name