\\\/\\\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\\\/jrtca-breeders\\\/&quot;,&quot;new_window&quot;:false}\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sow-slider-image-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"sow-slider-image-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<h1>JRTCA Breeders Directory<\/h1>\n<h4>Jack Russell Terriers<\/h4>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t<\/ul>\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"sow-slider-pagination\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"#\" data-goto=\"0\" aria-label=\"Display slide 1\"><\/a><\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ol>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sow-slide-nav sow-slide-nav-next\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" data-goto=\"next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\" data-action=\"next\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<em class=\"sow-sld-icon-thin-right\"><\/em>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sow-slide-nav sow-slide-nav-prev\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" data-goto=\"previous\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\" data-action=\"prev\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<em class=\"sow-sld-icon-thin-left\"><\/em>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-5-1\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-5-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-5-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"1\" ><h3 class=\"widget-title\">The Jack Russell Terrier<\/h3>\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p>The Jack Russell Terrier is a special and unique dog. The major objective of the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/jack-russell-terrier-club-of-america\/\">JRTCA<\/a> is to preserve this type of working terrier known as a Jack Russell with its outstanding natural hunting instincts, special character, outstanding intelligence, and unique individuality, as it has been bred for the past 150 years. All who seek adventure with this feisty little terrier should remember that the Jack Russell Terrier is first and foremost a hunting dog.\u00a0 It is not the dog for everyone. You are encouraged to learn as much as possible about the Jack Russell, and carefully evaluate whether it will suit your lifestyle (or rather, that you will suit the lifestyle of a Jack Russell!), before you make the commitment to purchase.<\/p>\n<p>There are many publications available through the JRTCA which will further enhance the knowledge of the purchaser. In all matters, the buyers must be aware of the many variations in the breed, and make a selection based on knowledge gained through this publication and other sources. And, of course, personal preferences.<\/p>\n<h3>JRTCA Breeders Directory<\/h3>\n<p>All <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/jrtca-breeders\/\">breeders listed in this Directory<\/a> are signatory to the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/code-of-ethics\/\">JRTCA Code of Ethics<\/a>, which we encourage you to carefully review. This Code of Ethics should be used by a prospective buyer as a guide when discussing the purchase of a puppy with a breeder.\u00a0<i>Please note this not the entire list of JRTCA breeders, just those who chose to advertise.<\/i><\/p>\n<p>The breeders listed have provided a complete list of registered breeding stock, are current members of the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.therealjackrussell.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jack Russell Terrier Club of America<\/a>, and have signed the JRTCA Breeders Code of Ethics. This Directory is an advertising tool for JRTCA breeders. The JRTCA does not endorse the breeders listed herein, or the quality of their produce, outside of the requirements stated in the JRTCA Code of Ethics.<\/p>\n<p>The test results listed in the ads have not been verified by the JRTCA. Please contact the breeder for documentation.<\/p>\n<h3>JRTCA Website and Questions<\/h3>\n<p>Before deciding to purchase a Jack Russell Terrier, please carefully review all information provided on the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.therealjackrussell.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">JRTCA&#8217;s website<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>If you have any other questions or concerns, please feel free to call us at (410) 561-3655 or email us\u00a0 at\u00a0 <a href=\"mailto:jrtca@therealjackrussell.com\">jrtca@therealjackrussell.com<\/a> (office hours: Monday-Friday 8:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m. Eastern Time)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-5-1-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-5-1-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-first-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><h3 class=\"widget-title\">JRTCA Breeders<\/h3>\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><h4><a href=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/jrtca-breeders\/\">List of JRTCA Breeders in Alphabetical and State Order<\/a><\/h4>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><div id=\"panel-5-1-1-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-last-child\" data-index=\"3\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743-5\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/jack-russell-terrier-club-of-america\/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/jrtcalogo.png\" width=\"125\" height=\"124\" sizes=\"(max-width: 125px) 100vw, 125px\" title=\"Jack Russell Terrier Club of America JRTCA\" alt=\"Jack Russell Terrier Club of America JRTCA\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t\t\t<\/a><\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Jack Russell Terrier is a special and unique dog. The major objective of the JRTCA is to preserve this type of working terrier known as a Jack Russell with its outstanding natural hunting instincts, special character, outstanding intelligence, and unique individuality, as it has been bred for the past 150 years. All who seek [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"home-panels.php","meta":{"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5